---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { brand, contacts, services } from '../data/site';
const year = 2026;
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col-brand">
        <div class="logo">
          <span class="mark"><Icon name="logo" size={17} stroke="#fff" width={1.9} /></span>
          <span><b>{brand.nameShort}</b><small>{brand.role}</small></span>
        </div>
        <p>Бухгалтерское обслуживание ИП и ООО в Оренбурге и области.</p>
        <div class="msgr">
          <a class="m-max" href={contacts.maxLink} aria-label="Написать в МАКС" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/assets/max.svg" alt="МАКС" /></a>
          <a class="m-tg" href={contacts.telegram} aria-label="Написать в Telegram" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M23.91 3.79L20.3 20.84c-.25 1.21-.98 1.5-2 .94l-5.5-4.07-2.66 2.57c-.3.3-.55.56-1.1.56l.4-5.62 10.24-9.25c.44-.39-.1-.61-.69-.22L6.35 13.4l-5.42-1.7c-1.18-.36-1.2-1.17.25-1.73L22.4 2.34c.98-.36 1.84.22 1.51 1.45z"/></svg></a>
          <a class="m-phone" href={contacts.phoneHref} aria-label="Позвонить"><Icon name="phone" size={18} stroke="#fff" width={1.9}/></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4>Услуги</h4>
        <div class="links">
          {services.slice(0, 6).map((s) => <a href={s.href}>{s.title}</a>)}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4>Контакты</h4>
        <div class="links">
          <a href={contacts.phoneHref}>{contacts.phone}</a>
          <a href={`mailto:${contacts.email}`}>{contacts.email}</a>
          <span>{contacts.address}</span>
          <span>{contacts.hours}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom">
      <span>© {year} «{brand.name}». Бухгалтерские услуги в Оренбурге.</span>
      <a href="/politika-konfidencialnosti/">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer { background: var(--ink); color: #c6d0e0; padding: 56px 0 28px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; padding-bottom: 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .mark { width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 1.6px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .logo b { display: block; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; }
  .logo small { color: #9fb0c6; font-size: 12px; }
  .col-brand p { font-size: 14px; max-width: 320px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  h4 { color: #fff; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; font-size: 15px; }
  .links a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .msgr { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .msgr a { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: transform .15s; }
  .msgr a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .m-max { background: transparent; }
  .m-max img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .m-tg { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2AABEE, #229ED9); }
  .m-tg svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .m-phone { background: var(--green); }
  .bottom { padding-top: 22px; font-size: 13px; color: #8ba0ba; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } }
</style>
